        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Most pieces of writing open with a shared context, as does 1b. In this example, the shared context is an observation about a common belief, practice, or perception, but it might have been historical background, an event, or anything else that introduces the topic in a way that readers will readily accept.",
            "block_bbox": [
