        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Common Belief, Practice, or Perception: Recycling—the practice of separating from ordinary trash specific materials that can be made into new products—is today an expected and even habitual behavior: to toss an aluminium can in an ordinary trash bin is as unthinkable as it would be to toss it into the street or a neighbor's yard. shared context But many people...",
            "block_bbox": [
