        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Event: Every November 15, thousands of people gather at events across the country to celebrate America Recycles Day. The popularity of these events indicates how ordinary the practice of recycling has become. It is now just something that people do as a matter of course.  $ \\underline{\\text{shared context}} $ But many people...",
            "block_bbox": [
