        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "These forms of shared context play a special role in motivating readers to read on. In 1b, we wanted you to accept that context as a seemingly unproblematic base for thinking about recycling just so that we could then challenge it. We set you up so that we could say, in effect, You may think you know the whole story, but you don't. That but signals the coming qualification:",
            "block_bbox": [
                89,
                665,
